者來⾃芸香科的藥材？","opts":["黃連","黃柏","知⺟","梔⼦"],"ans":"B","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":70,"q":"下列何者為固醇類⽣物鹼？","opts":["cinchonidine","caffeine","protoveratrine A","pilocarpine"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":71,"q":"麥⾓⽣物鹼成分中，下列何者屬非⽔溶性？","opts":["ergometrine","ergotamine","ergonovine","ergometrinine"],"ans":"B","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":72,"q":"下列有關吳茱萸之基原科別、學名及⽣藥名之配對，何者正確？","opts":["Sterculiaceae－Sterculia lychnophora－Sterculiae Semen","Solanaceae－Lycium chinensis－Lycii Radicis Cortex","Rutaceae－Evodia rutaecarpa－Evodiae Fructus","Magnoliaceae－Magnolia biondii－Magnoliae Flos"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":73,"q":"下列有關tropane alkaloid之敘述，何者正確？","opts":["具三環結構之化合物","由吡咯啶（pyrrolidine）與2分⼦⼄酸縮合⽽成","主要分布於唇形科植物","其⽣合成前驅物（precursor）為⿃胺酸（ornithine）"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":74,"q":"⽣藥calabar bean的植物基原為何？","opts":["Strychnos ignatii","Physostigma venenosum","Pilocarpus microphyllus","Aconitum napellus"],"ans":"B","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":75,"q":"下列何者為isoquinoline類⽣物鹼？","opts":["quinidine","reserpine","morphine","caffeine"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":76,"q":"下列何種⽣物鹼之氮原⼦不在環狀結構上？","opts":["arecoline","yohimbine","colchicine","codeine"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":77,"q":"下列藥材及其基原之配對何者錯誤？","opts":["川芎－Ligusticum chuanxiong Hort.","北柴胡－Bupleurum chinense DC.","黃精－Dioscorea bulbifera L.","天⿇－Gastrodia elata Bl."],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":78,"q":"Spearmint oil中主要含下列何種成分？","opts":["d-citronellol","l-citronellol","d-carvone","l-carvone"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":79,"q":"清熱解毒藥中，含forsythiaside成分者為何？","opts":["敗醬草","板藍根","⾦銀花","連翹"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":80,"q":"下列敘述，何項錯誤？","opts":["毒扁豆為豆科植物，產於⻄非","毒扁豆鹼可⽤於散瞳","⾺錢⼦種⼦為盤狀","reserpine為蛇根⽊之重要成分"],"ans":"B","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]}],"answer":"https://wwwq.moex.gov.tw/exam/wHandExamQandA_File.as